message: >-
  This package is an independent implementation of the Fourier contour cell
  model of Saito and Ishihara. If you use it, please cite their paper
  (preferred citation below) and this software.
title: "FourierContourCells.jl: a Julia implementation of the Fourier contour cell model"
type: software
